Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:46.40,H_en,,0,0,0,,"I fear nothing. I run a spirit altar. I am the NEMESIS of evil ghosts."
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:46.40,C_en,,0,0,0,,Watch ALL episodes FREE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:02.81,S_en,,0,0,0,,What's there to be scared of?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.85,0:00:03.81,S_en,,0,0,0,,My altar is established.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.85,0:00:05.81,S_en,,0,0,0,,I'm the nemesis of evil ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.85,0:00:06.88,S_en,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:09.00,S_en,,0,0,0,,How dare you barge in?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.04,0:00:14.14,S_en,,0,0,0,,That's the ghost immortal our altar just recruited.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.18,0:00:15.14,S_en,,0,0,0,,He passed the assessment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:16.17,S_en,,0,0,0,,You child,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.21,0:00:18.17,S_en,,0,0,0,,look carefully before you speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.21,0:00:19.17,S_en,,0,0,0,,So my discomfort
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.21,0:00:21.59,S_en,,0,0,0,,is because of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.63,0:00:23.59,S_en,,0,0,0,,He's been staying on your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.63,0:00:24.59,S_en,,0,0,0,,You didn't sense him
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.63,0:00:26.59,S_en,,0,0,0,,or send him to the back hall to cultivate,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.63,0:00:27.59,S_en,,0,0,0,,no wonder you've felt awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.63,0:00:28.59,S_en,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say so earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.63,0:00:29.59,S_en,,0,0,0,,You recruited him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.63,0:00:30.59,S_en,,0,0,0,,After vetting him,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.63,0:00:31.59,S_en,,0,0,0,,just send him straight to the back hall —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.63,0:00:32.59,S_en,,0,0,0,,wouldn't that settle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.63,0:00:33.59,S_en,,0,0,0,,Nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:35.59,S_en,,0,0,0,,The altar has rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.63,0:00:36.59,S_en,,0,0,0,,When a spirit enters,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.63,0:00:37.59,S_en,,0,0,0,,the medium must know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.63,0:00:38.59,S_en,,0,0,0,,and must question them clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.63,0:00:39.59,S_en,,0,0,0,,Otherwise any random cat or dog
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.63,0:00:41.59,S_en,,0,0,0,,could cultivate here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.63,0:00:44.42,S_en,,0,0,0,,May I ask your honored name, ghost immortal?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.46,0:00:45.42,S_en,,0,0,0,,Where do you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.46,0:00:46.40,S_en,,0,0,0,,What powers do you command?
